        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, at cogen 160kWe Jakobsberg, allocation energy</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, at cogen 160kWe Jakobsberg, allocation energy
The multioutput-process 'natural gas, burned in cogen 160kWe Jakobsberg, allocation energy' delivers the coproducts 'electricity, at cogen 160kWe Jakobsberg, allocation energy' and 'heat, at cogen 160kWe Jakobsberg, allocation energy'.;
UUID: 58aa72c6-bad3-333b-b24f-da76367956cf
The module includes fuel input, infrastructure, emissions to air, and substances needed for operation.
Location: Efficiencies refer to a specific plant in Switzerland.
Technology: Specific cogeneration unit installed in Switzerland.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Emission measurements of operator, literature. Efficiencies from operator data. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_58aa72c6-bad3-333b-b24f-da76367956cf.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
